{"4050260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "King's Haven", "steam_appid": 4050260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck of Citizens to defend your kingdom from various monsters. Each Card acts as a unit on board, and a Citizen in your kingdom. During the day you will play your cards to defeat monsters  at the gates of your kingdom. You will also make choices in dynamic story events, that will shape the future of your kingdom, and your people. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend against monsters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every season there will be a new threat at your gate, make sure they are dealt with before they reach your Haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/94dc41a015938462971d19710937dad2.poster.avif?t=1787772210\" width=1152 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/94dc41a015938462971d19710937dad2.webm?t=1787772210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/94dc41a015938462971d19710937dad2.mp4?t=1787772210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Invite over 100 Different Citizen to your kingdom, all with unique effects!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night you will get the option to invite a Citizen to your kingdom! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/7fc128c9c3e16caaf74e28b5a3023904.poster.avif?t=1787772210\" width=1152 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/7fc128c9c3e16caaf74e28b5a3023904.webm?t=1787772210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/7fc128c9c3e16caaf74e28b5a3023904.mp4?t=1787772210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your kingdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each landmark comes with an unique effect, so be mindful where you build them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/623219ccb150660872a86b12071c3450.poster.avif?t=1787772210\" width=1152 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/623219ccb150660872a86b12071c3450.webm?t=1787772210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/623219ccb150660872a86b12071c3450.mp4?t=1787772210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck of Citizens to defend your kingdom from various monsters. Each Card acts as a unit on board, and a Citizen in your kingdom. During the day you will play your cards to defeat monsters  at the gates of your kingdom. You will also make choices in dynamic story events, that will shape the future of your kingdom, and your people. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend against monsters!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every season there will be a new threat at your gate, make sure they are dealt with before they reach your Haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050260/extras/94dc41a015938462971d19710937dad2.poster.avif?t=1787772210\" width=1152 height=444 ><source s